{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52739","headline":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 七 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"参，总有十星觜相侵。\n两肩䨥足三爲心，伐有三星足里深。\n玉井四星右足阴，屏星两扇井南襟。\n军井四星屏上吟，左足下四天厠临，厠下一物天屎沉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}